  '{"text":"Manifest","id":"q7d9mj"}]',
  ',"haul.order":[',
  '{"text":"Which stop next?","id":"1blrkte"}]',
  ',"haul.stop.bridge":[',
  '{"text":"the bridge, Deck 1","id":"1pxel8k"}]',
  ',"haul.stop.galley":[',
  '{"text":"the galley, Deck 3","id":"1nady6w"}]',
  ',"haul.stop.infirmary":[',
  '{"text":"the infirmary, Deck 3","id":"1d3ykoa"}]',
  ',"haul.stop.laundry":[',
  '{"text":"the laundry, Deck 4","id":"1hyosrj"}]',
  ',"haul.stop.store":[',
  '{"text":"the crew store, Deck 3","id":"1fprd5h"}]',
  ',"haul.thanks":[',
  '{"text":"Oh, lovely. Just where I wanted it.","id":"1ojxui5"},',
  '{"text":"Delivery! You\'re a star. Put it there, by the wall.","id":"1qobt2c"},',
  '{"text":"That\'s this week\'s lot. Thank you.","id":"1cmvwvu"}]',
  ',"haul.tidy":[',
  '{"text":"A tidy run.","id":"n3sbjf"}]',
  ',"haul.title":[',
  '{"text":"Manifest run: {n} crates","id":"146198b"}]',
  ',"hello":[',
  '{"text":"{hi}. You\'re the new one, aren\'t you? Welcome aboard.","id":"gfrker","tier":[0,0]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Settling in all right?","id":"1lewn3e","tier":[0,0]},',
  '{"text":"Oh, {hi}. I\'ve seen you about. Nice to meet you properly.","id":"2nsh5d","tier":[0,0]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Don\'t worry, nobody knows where anything is for a week.","id":"1wsosu4","tone":"funny","tier":[0,0]},',
  '{"text":"Hello, new face. You\'ll be fine. Everyone\'s friendly here.","id":"1hxnlcc","tier":[0,0]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. If you get lost, follow the smell of toast to the mess.","id":"1y9nu6u","tone":"funny","tier":[0,0]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}, {nick}. Getting the hang of the place?","id":"10692mb","tier":[1,1]},',
  '{"text":"Oh, {hi}. Good to see you again.","id":"pzcmie","tier":[1,1]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Still finding your way? You\'re doing well.","id":"tcmr0v","tier":[1,1]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}, {nick}. Busy day?","id":"g7sfmc","tier":[1,1]},',
  '{"text":"Hey, it\'s you. How\'s the Wren treating you?","id":"tre849","tier":[1,1]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Found the good tea yet? Lounge, top shelf.","id":"1cex3z","tier":[1,1]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}, {nick}. Same time tomorrow?","id":"tq00sv","tier":[2,2]},',
  '{"text":"There you are. {hi}.","id":"16nyn0c","tier":[2,2]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. You look like you know where you\'re going today.","id":"u0fao3","tone":"funny","tier":[2,2]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}, {nick}. Good shift?","id":"1z0eh2u","tier":[2,2]},',
  '{"text":"Oh, {hi}. I was just thinking I hadn\'t seen you.","id":"1dtk3ir","tier":[2,2]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Off anywhere nice?","id":"z2avux","tier":[2,2]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}, {nick}. Made my day, that.","id":"1c1ggds","tone":"warm","tier":[3,3]},',
  '{"text":"Oh good, it\'s you. {hi}.","id":"1jy7nox","tier":[3,3]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}! Come and find me later. I\'ve got news.","id":"1cs71tw","tier":[3,3]},',
  '{"text":"{nick}! I was hoping I\'d see you.","id":"18z069x","tone":"warm","tier":[3,3]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. You look well. The Wren suits you.","id":"kfgjo9","tier":[3,3]},',
  '{"text":"There\'s my favourite new hand. {hi}.","id":"gc567l","tone":"funny","tier":[3,3]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}, {nick}. Always good to see your face.","id":"l8aqca","tone":"warm","tier":[4,4]},',
  '{"text":"Oh, it\'s you. Everything\'s better already.","id":"18btdpg","tone":"warm","tier":[4,4]},',
  '{"text":"{nick}! Sit with me at dinner?","id":"7bje2g","tier":[4,4]},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Don\'t go far. I want a proper catch-up.","id":"gbnx3j","tone":"warm","tier":[4,4]},',
  '{"text":"Morning. Don\'t talk to me till tea. Kidding. {hi}.","id":"1an270n","tone":"funny","time":"morning"},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Early one, isn\'t it?","id":"s5va37","time":"morning"},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Shift\'s done. Best part of the day, this.","id":"bcvch2","time":"evening"},',
  '{"text":"Evening, {nick}. Doing anything nice tonight?","id":"1u4iykb","time":"evening"},',
  '{"text":"{hi}. Shouldn\'t you be asleep? Shouldn\'t I?","id":"1ginqq2","tone":"funny","time":"night"}]',
  ',"hobby.button":[',
  '{"text":"Hobby","id":"7viags"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.draw":[',
  '{"text":"A sketch you\'re quietly pleased with.","id":"eujzpt"},',
  '{"text":"Not bad. Not bad at all.","id":"16m1m3y"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.film":[',
  '{"text":"The credits roll. That was nice.","id":"e5aa9b"},',
  '{"text":"Good film. You\'d watch it again.","id":"no4o0z"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.games":[',
  '{"text":"Game over. You nearly had it. Next time.","id":"1ygibe5"},',
  '{"text":"You win one, lose one. Fair enough.","id":"10i1ejr"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.garden":[',
  '{"text":"The bed looks tidier. The leaves look happier.","id":"1uhmmqx"},',
  '{"text":"Your hands smell of soil and mint. Lovely.","id":"kzyzf7"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.knit":[',
  '{"text":"A few more rows. It\'s starting to look like something.","id":"159usxn"},',
  '{"text":"Knit, purl, done. It\'s getting longer.","id":"hbwwmv"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.puzzle":[',
  '{"text":"Solved. You feel very clever.","id":"1ougxsr"},',
  '{"text":"One puzzle done. The next one looks harder.","id":"1wii9as"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.read":[',
  '{"text":"You finish a chapter. That was nice.","id":"1ld8su9"},',
  '{"text":"You read till the end of the chapter. Just one more? No. Maybe.","id":"1ep90tg"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.stars":[',
  '{"text":"The stars drift past. You feel calm.","id":"m03p36"},',
  '{"text":"You spot a bright one you haven\'t seen before.","id":"ew9k8z"}]',
  ',"hobby.done.write":[',
  '{"text":"You write a page. Your head feels tidier.","id":"fg9xmk"},',
  '{"text":"A few lines in your journal. Today\'s down on paper now.","id":"bjqufy"}]',
  ',"hobby.drew":[',
  '{"text":"You sketch the view from the {room}. The stars came out well.","id":"s3z16t"},',
  '{"text":"A quick drawing of the {room}. You got the light just right.","id":"1utujnj"},',
  '{"text":"You draw the {room} as it is tonight. Something to keep.","id":"fl2gyx"}]',
